<h1>Belonging, wherever life takes you.</h1>
<p class="story-byline">By Favorite Hearts</p>
</div>
<figure class="story-cover">
<img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/5910748/pexels-photo-5910748.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=2000&amp;q=90" alt="A couple sharing time and conversation together" width="1600" height="1067" fetchpriority="high" data-stock-fallback="/assets/labs-couple.jpg" decoding="async">
</figure>
<div class="story-copy">
<p class="story-intro">Home can mean a place, a language, a tradition, or the people who understand you. For Sri Lankans around the world, a shared future can bring more than one idea of home together.</p>
<section>
<h2>A broad idea of home</h2>
<p>Sri Lankan lives span different countries, languages, beliefs, and family traditions. Our vision makes room for that variety rather than assuming everyone wants the same future.</p>
</section>
<section>
<h2>Tradition and personal choice</h2>
<p>People can cherish family and culture while making their own decisions about marriage. We believe those conversations deserve patience and respect.</p>
</section>
<section>
<h2>What we hope to contribute</h2>
<p>We want to encourage more thoughtful introductions and a sense of possibility across communities. This is an aspiration guiding our work, rather than a claim of measured social impact.</p>
</section>
<aside class="story-summary" aria-labelledby="summary-title">
<h2 id="summary-title">In brief</h2>
<p>There is more than one way to feel at home or build a family. Our vision welcomes the variety of Sri Lankan lives around the world, with room for cultural traditions, personal choice, and thoughtful introductions across communities.</p>
</aside>
<a class="pill story-back" href="/newsroom/">
<span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Back to newsroom</a>
